# ── ICE — what never belongs in the repository ──────────────────────────
# Everything listed here is created by the app on first run. A fresh clone with
# none of it present boots straight to the setup screen, which is the intended
# first experience — so nothing here needs to be committed, and some of it must
# never be.

# ── Secrets. Committing any of these publishes them. ──────────────────────────
# NOTE: git does not support inline comments in .gitignore — every character
# after a pattern is treated as part of the pattern. Keep comments on their own
# lines or these secrets silently stop being ignored.

# your Gemini API key, plus per-plugin credentials
config/api_keys.json
# the dashboard's TLS private key and certificate
config/certs/
# a LINKED WhatsApp session — committing it hands somebody your WhatsApp account
config/whatsapp_web/
# Google OAuth tokens (Gmail / Calendar plugins)
**/token*.json
# Google OAuth client secrets
**/client_secret*.json
*credentials*.json
.env
.env.*

# ── Personal data the assistant accumulates about you ─────────────────────────
memory/long_term.json
memory/*.db
# Conversation-derived suggestions and usage telemetry are local-only too.
config/improvements.json
config/ui_strategies.json
config/usage_counts.json
# The self-training ledger: how well each capability has actually performed on
# this machine, plus the rules it wrote itself. Local behaviour, local file.
config/self_training.json
# What autonomous mode did with the time it was given: the mood it is in, the
# interests it gathered and the findings it kept. Personal to this machine —
# the same reason the training ledger is not repo content.
config/initiative.json

# Trading journal, paper account, alerts, and risk settings — personal
# financial data (positions, P/L, account size, limits). Never repo content.
config/trading_journal.json
config/paper_account.json
config/trading_alerts.json
config/trading_settings.json

# ── Python build noise ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
*.so
build/
dist/
*.egg-info/
.eggs/

# ── Virtual environments ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.venv/
venv/
env/
ENV/

# ── Editors and operating systems ─────────────────────────────────────────────
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# ── Runtime output ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
*.log
logs/
downloads/
screenshots/

# ── Update packaging/staging output — goes to a GitHub Release, not git
JARVIS_update.zip
ICE-JARVIS-Windows-x64.zip
update.json
apply_update.bat
update_staging/

# Local build helpers and visual scratch artifacts.
.freebuff/
_orig_ui.py
preview_bundle.html
